    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d43">

                <pb facs="0132" n="96" sameAs="frus:frus1964-68v11/pg96"/>

                <head>43. Summary of Actions<anchor n="1" xml:id="d43-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1964-08-12T17:00:00-04:00">August 12, 1964, 5 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">MEETING OF THE COMMITTEE OF PRINCIPALS</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">1. Statement Relating to a Reduction of Military
                        Expenditures</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Reference: August 11 ACDA Memorandum for Members of the Committee of Principals,
                    Subject: Recommended Content of a Joint Statement relating to a Reduction of
                    Military Expenditures.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d43-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>At an appropriate occasion a statement may be made in the ENDC utilizing the
                    substance of paragraphs 5 and 6 of the draft attached to reference paper;
                    statement would also relate question of military expenditures to broad U.S.
                    disarmament objectives.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d43-f3"/>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">2. Other Business</hi>
                </p>
                <p>A new ACDA non-dissemination paper, responsive to the discussions at the 16 June
                    meeting, will be distributed this week to the Principals.<anchor n="4"
                        xml:id="d43-f4"/>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
